            "id": "s1:p1",
            "text": "Sphagnum subnitens is a species of moss belonging to the family Sphagnaceae."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p2",
            "text": "It has almost cosmopolitan distribution."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p3",
            "text": "Characteristics\nThis moss type is known to form as either dense cushions or hummocks."
          },
          {
            "id": "s1:p4",
            "text": "Habitat\nSphagnum subnitens occurs in several environments:\nBoggy grassland\nMarshes\nFens and Flushes\nDitches\nWet woodland\nHeather banks\nBlanket bogs"
          }
        ]
      }
